		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Malign undead plants that sprout from mass bloodshed. Tangled grey roots and vines.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 12, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 vine +1 (1d6 + gory bleed) and bloodthirst, <strong>MV</strong> close (burrow), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bloodthirst</strong>. If within close of bleeding creature, regains 1d6 HP on its turn.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gory Bleed</strong>. 1d4 damage each round. CON 12+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch. Magical healing is at DISADV on bleeding targets.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
